Package: JAGG
Type: Package
Title: 'ggplot2' Graphics and Diagnostics for 'JABBA' and 'JARA'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Henning", "Winker", email = "henning.winker@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Provides 'ggplot2' versions of the plots and model diagnostics
    for the Bayesian state-space surplus production model 'JABBA' (Just
    Another Bayesian Biomass Assessment) and the Bayesian state-space trend
    model 'JARA' (Just Another Red-List Assessment). Converts fitted 'JABBA'
    and 'JARA' objects, hindcasts and lists of scenario runs into standard
    tidy data frames, and plots stock status trajectories with nested
    credible intervals and colour-coded reference points, index fits,
    residual diagnostics, runs tests, retrospective analysis, hindcast
    cross-validation with the mean absolute scaled error (MASE), posterior
    predictive checks and ensembles. 'JABBA' and 'JARA' themselves are not
    required to draw plots from their saved output, and their base-graphics
    plots are left unchanged.
